	(text_box "A:Values of RT1 AND RT2 IS VALID IF THE BELOW RECOMMENDED THERMISTER IS USED (Thermistor 103AT-2)\nB: When TS pin is not used: connect a RT1=10-kΩ resistor RT2 = 10-kΩ resistor from TS to GND\nC: 1% or higher accuracy of resistors is needed for R1 and R2 resisitors. For a 1-cell 4.2-V battery, R21 = 562 kΩ and R22 = 200 kΩ \nFor a 2-cell 8.4-V,battery, R21 = 1.33MΩ and R22 = 200 kΩ\nD: INDUCTOR VALUE DEPENDENT ON VBUS_MAX IS <6.2V THEN INDUCTOR (L2)= 1.0uH\nVBUS_MAX IS >6.2V THEN INDUCTOR (L2)= 2.2uH"
